<title>USA: PJ America Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>PJ America Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    Mar 30,	Mar 29,</p>
<p>							1997	  1996</p>
<p> Restaurant sales				$8,770	 $6,606</p>
<p> Net income					   728	    291</p>
<p> Net income per share			    0.15	   0.09</p>
<p> Wtd. average shares			    4,882	  3,120</p>
<p>(All data above in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company reported pro forma information for the first quarter ended March 29, 1996 includes all restaurants included in the IPO, as if they were operated by PJ America for the entire period presented.</p>
</text>
